e65d48e2e8f9d61517380f9e4dffac9663f","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-dimension-free-logarithmic-Sobolev-inequality-for-subgaussian-log-concave-measures-September-23-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L26"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nThere is an absolute constant \\(C<\\infty\\) with the following property.\nFor every \\(n\\ge1\\), every centered log-concave probability measure\n\\(\\mu\\) with a Lebesgue density on \\(\\R^n\\), and every \\(a>0\\)\nsatisfying \\eqref{eq:intro-subgaussian} for \\(X\\sim\\mu\\),\n\\[\n \\Ent_\\mu(f^2)\\le C a^2\\int_{\\R^n}|Df|^2\\,d\\mu\n \\qquad\\text{for every }f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\R^n).\n\\]\nThe same constant works in every dimension."},{"appendix":false,"contribution_target":{"fingerprint":"sha256:3508cec6d68d97dd3c1971f84b05972a24be5295d868430c48867267d1b55c83","grain":"paper-statement","id":"A-dimension-free-logarithmic-Sobolev-inequality-for-subgaussian-log-concave-measures-September-23-2026#cor:intro-transport","title":"Quadratic transport--entropy inequality"},"credit":{"kind":"producer-declared","license":null,"license_status":"consult-source-notice","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","repository":"https://github.com/openai/math","source":"lean/formalization.yaml","source_registry":"index.json#/sources"},"detail":{"path":"../rows/4e9f99372c2a2af5af6a8755.json","pointer":"/row"},"display":"Corollary","id":"r:A-dimension-free-logarithmic-Sobolev-inequality-for-subgaussian-log-concave-measures-September-23-2026:cor:intro-transport","manuscript_id":"p:A-dimension-free-logarithmic-Sobolev-inequality-for-subgaussian-log-concave-measures-September-23-2026","name":"Quadratic transport--entropy inequality","printed_number":"1.2","printed_number_provenance":{"atlas_pin":"755c4b729512c7e2c7d1d3303eb9706f5adf1681","binding":{"file":"build/sections/01-introduction.tex","label":"cor:intro-transport","line":57,"manuscript":"A-dime